ecial abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 types of magic wands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">many secret places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">aesthetics of graphics and music from 8-16-bit consoles</p></li></ul>","developers":["Spell Pie","Uncle Frost Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/cf31128639b49e8a68b5312a9e69d6630c1cd92e/header.jpg?t=1744961863","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126251,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126251/movie480.mp4?t=1744828398","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126251/movie_max.mp4?t=1744828398"},"name":"Farlands Journey - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126251/091cedca7f38e0804bb9cd8e710e2d9eedb2bab8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744828398","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126251/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744828398","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126251/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744828398"}}],"name":"Farlands Journey","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3220 / AMD FX 4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 730 / Radeon HD 5670<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br